  "goodToKnow": "Die Lagerstätte is a mineral deposit: Lagerstätten von Kohle, Erz, Erdgas, Lithium. A synonym is das Vorkommen. It also means a storage site, and Germany is still searching for an Endlager (final repository) for high-level nuclear waste after the Gorleben site was ruled out in 2020. Die Stätte means site: Gedenkstätte, Arbeitsstätte. Plural: die Lagerstätten."
